      "id": "word-de--fixed-de-cabeza",
      "kind": "word",
      "promptEs": "de",
      "answerEn": "no separate English word; part of de cabeza (“headfirst”)",
      "noteEn": "In the fixed movement expression de cabeza, de introduces the body part that leads. The two words work together rather than using de in its ordinary “of” sense.",
